   "text": "OBSERVATION POST VACCINATION",
   "bbox": [
    279.0,
    48.7,
    566.7,
    71.0
   ],
   "key": "p14-bed33a65"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e04",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "• Observe patient for at least 15 minutes after vaccination. If patient known with severe allergies: observe for 30 minutes. • Check for signs or symptoms that may indicate an adverse reaction:",
   "bbox": [
    51.0,
    89.5,
    491.8,
    109.7
   ],
   "key": "p14-68b379cb"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e05",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Collapse 15.",
   "bbox": [
    52.6,
    185.5,
    105.4,
    196.4
   ],
   "key": "p14-cb8e7b23"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e06",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Feeling faint/unwell symptoms • Light-headedness or dizziness • Feeling warm or cold • Sweating • Palpitations • Visual 'blurring' (darkening or white-out of vision) • Reduced hearing ('whooshing' noise) • Pallor reported by onlookers",
   "bbox": [
    143.9,
    121.8,
    330.6,
    202.8
   ],
   "key": "p14-291dfff8"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e07",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Skin/mucosal symptoms",
   "bbox": [
    452.4,
    121.8,
    549.1,
    132.8
   ],
   "key": "p14-e0ebf2fb"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e08",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "• Itchiness • Skin rash (hives) • Swelling of eyes, lips, tongue, face, or hands/feet • Nasal congestion",
   "bbox": [
    434.8,
    218.2,
    568.3,
    268.4
   ],
   "key": "p14-31431995"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e09",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Respiratory symptoms",
   "bbox": [
    594.4,
    121.8,
    683.5,
    132.8
   ],
   "key": "p14-0dd8ad75"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e10",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "• Wheeze or cough • Throat tightness • Stridor • Shortness of breath • Hoarseness • Oxygen sats < 92% • Trouble swallowing • Drooling",
   "bbox": [
    593.6,
    213.4,
    672.9,
    293.6
   ],
   "key": "p14-b6577256"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e11",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Gastrointestinal",
   "bbox": [
    725.0,
    121.8,
    790.3,
    132.8
   ],
   "key": "p14-570613b9"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e12",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "symptoms",
   "bbox": [
    736.0,
    131.8,
    779.2,
    142.8
   ],
   "key": "p14-0b6b7ca8"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e13",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "• Nausea • Vomiting • Diarrhoea • Cramps",
   "bbox": [
    711.2,
    222.7,
    754.9,
    262.9
   ],
   "key": "p14-336295ee"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e14",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "• Ask patient to lean forward with head between knees, or lie down flat, for several minutes until feeling better. • Loosen tight clothing – undo buttons around neck, loosen tie/belt. • Apply a cool cloth to face or neck. • Calmly reassure patient.",
   "bbox": [
    143.9,
    215.2,
    401.9,
    265.4
   ],
   "key": "p14-32e6d85e"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e15",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Do symptom/s improve quickly (minutes)?",
   "bbox": [
    198.7,
    277.8,
    354.5,
    288.0
   ],
   "key": "p14-85985016"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e16",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Yes",
   "bbox": [
    273.4,
    355.5,
    285.4,
    365.7
   ],
   "key": "p14-84495d00"
  },
  {
   "id": "p14-out-e17",
   "page": 14,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Yes",
   "bbox": [
    335.8,
    378.3,
